        "t0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Nitric oxide is a signalling molecule your body makes for itself. It tells the smooth muscle lining your blood vessels to relax, which keeps those vessels broad and supports circulation to every organ. Production peaks in your twenties and falls from there.</p><p>BIO N:OV is a 3rd-generation nitric oxide supplement. Rather than supplying a precursor your body has to convert, it is produced by patented microbial fermentation and releases NO on contact with stomach acid — no enzyme conversion required.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
